      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I got the gaslighting bug too last night. My friend (call them friend 1) and I were hanging out by ourselves when we decided to join onto another friend (call them friend 2). I joined off of friend 2. And friend 1 was nowhere to be seen. Not even in the instance player list. I was talking with friend 2 for a few mins before I asked where friend 1 was. He looked at me like I was crazy. He asked me if I could see friend 1. I said no, and I rejoined the instance. The moment I rejoined, I could see friend 1.\n\nThis has happened to me before with other people, and the only fix is to rejoin the instance. I just checked the vrchat logs, and friend 1's name did not show up in the place where OnPlayerJoined events happen.\n\nI'm on build 1552. Is there anywhere I can upload my log?",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
