  "details": "Joined a user on my friend list, but I can't see the user in the world. No avatar, no nameplate, nothing. Does not appear on the \"HERE\" list in the world. But does appear in the log files. When using udon a teleport udon gimmick that's in the world, I can actually teleport to that user.\n\nAlready contacted someone that explained it's a rare Gaslight bug and statistically only happens once a year. So I assumed that this will be fixed when that person logins again the next day.\n\nNEXT DAY\n\nThis is still the case. And I'm pretty confused now.",
